Subject: [PATCH 179/181] dt-bindings: iio: light: stk33xx: Add STK3A5X

The Sensortek STK3A5X ambient light and proximity sensor keeps the
STK3310 register layout, so it takes the STK3310 as its fallback.
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iio/light/stk33xx.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iio/light/stk33xx.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iio/light/stk33xx.yaml
index f655a570a..8b084dd5d 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iio/light/stk33xx.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iio/light/stk33xx.yaml
@@ -27,6 +27,7 @@ properties:
           - enum:
               - sensortek,stk3013
               - sensortek,stk36c61
+              - sensortek,stk3a5x
           - const: sensortek,stk3310
 
   reg:
